<section class="bg-base-100 text-base-content">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[80rem] px-5 pt-14 md:px-8 md:pt-20">
    <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-end lg:gap-10">
      <div class="lg:col-span-8">
        <p class="sign-label text-base-content/75">Our story</p>
        <h1 class="mt-4 text-[clamp(2.75rem,5vw+1rem,5rem)] leading-[0.98]">A grandmother&rsquo;s recipes on a yellow truck</h1>
      </div>
      <p class="body-copy max-w-[40ch] text-[1.125rem] lg:col-span-4">Pasada is the word for a jeepney driver&rsquo;s run along his route. Ours goes around Durham, five days a week.</p>
    </div>
    <img src="/media/trucks-in-the-park.jpg" class="mt-12 aspect-[4/3] w-full rounded-box object-cover md:aspect-[21/9]">
    <div class="grid gap-12 py-20 md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-10 md:py-28" data-reveal="stagger">
      <div>
        <p class="mono text-[0.875rem] text-base-content/70">1998 · Jacksonville, NC</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-[1.75rem]">Lola&rsquo;s kitchen</h2>
        <p class="body-copy mt-4">Jo grew up in a Navy family on the coast, at her grandmother&rsquo;s elbow. Lola Nena cooked for every ship that came home: adobo by the pot, lumpia by the hundred, rice that never ran out.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="mono text-[0.875rem] text-base-content/70">2013 · Durham</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-[1.75rem]">Eight years on the line</h2>
        <p class="body-copy mt-4">She came to Durham for a line cook&rsquo;s job and stayed for eight years in its kitchens, learning speed, the grill and how to feed a dining room in an hour. The binder of Lola&rsquo;s recipes stayed in her locker.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="mono text-[0.875rem] text-base-content/70">2021 · East Durham</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-[1.75rem]">A step van called Nena</h2>
        <p class="body-copy mt-4">A retired 2012 step van came up at auction. Jo and Theo painted it calamansi yellow in a friend&rsquo;s barn, named it after Lola and opened the window on Parrish Street that spring.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
